---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="School Life | Sarh Al Elm Private School" lang="en" description="Discover the learning environment and student experience at Sarh Al Elm Private School in Muscat."><section class="hero"><div class="wrap"><p>Beyond the classroom</p><h1>A school experience built around learning, belonging and growth</h1><span>At Sarh Al Elm, school life is about helping children develop academically while growing in confidence, curiosity and responsibility.</span></div></section><section class="intro wrap"><div><p class="kicker">The student experience</p><h2>Learning happens throughout the school day</h2></div><p>Our aim is to create an environment where students feel safe, supported and ready to participate. Classroom learning is complemented by opportunities to communicate, collaborate, explore interests and celebrate progress.</p></section><section class="life-photos wrap" aria-label="School life at Sarh Al Elm"><figure class="life-main"><img src="/images/school/06-team-activity.jpg" alt="Sarh Al Elm students taking part in a team activity" loading="lazy" /><figcaption><b>Participation and teamwork</b><span>Students learn through taking part, working together and sharing experiences.</span></figcaption></figure><figure><img src="/images/school/09-sports-activity.jpg" alt="Sarh Al Elm students taking part in a school sports activity" loading="lazy" /><figcaption><b>Active school life</b><span>School activities give students opportunities to participate and develop confidence.</span></figcaption></figure></section><section class="cards wrap"><article><h3>Learning & discovery</h3><p>Students are encouraged to ask questions, practise essential skills and take an active role in their learning.</p></article><article><h3>Language & communication</h3><p>A bilingual learning environment supports communication, understanding and connection across the school community.</p></article><article><h3>Belonging & wellbeing</h3><p>We value a respectful school culture where children can feel known, supported and part of the community.</p></article><article><h3>Activities & participation</h3><p>School activities give students opportunities to participate, work with others and develop interests beyond routine lessons.</p></article></section><section class="gallery-cta"><div class="wrap"><div><p class="kicker">See the school in action</p><h2>Explore moments from Sarh Al Elm</h2></div><a href="/gallery/">Visit the school gallery →</a></div></section><section class="visit"><div class="wrap"><h2>Interested in joining our school community?</h2><p>Our admissions team can answer questions about Grades 1–8 and guide families through the enquiry process.</p><a class="btn-primary" href="/admissions/">Start an admission enquiry</a></div></section></BaseLayout>
<style>
.hero{background:linear-gradient(rgba(4,34,62,.72),rgba(4,34,62,.8)),url('/images/hero-2.jpg') center/cover;color:#fff;padding:105px 0}.hero p,.kicker{font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;font-weight:700;color:#d5a43f}.hero h1{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(38px,5.5vw,60px);line-height:1.08;max-width:850px;margin:10px 0 18px}.hero span{display:block;max-width:680px;color:#e1eaf2;font-size:17px}.intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:70px;padding-top:78px;padding-bottom:42px}.intro h2,.gallery-cta h2,.visit h2{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:32px;color:var(--navy-dark);line-height:1.2;margin-top:8px}.intro>p{color:var(--slate);font-size:16px}.life-photos{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:18px;padding-bottom:62px}.life-photos figure{margin:0;position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:16px;background:#eef3f7;box-shadow:0 16px 40px rgba(4,34,62,.1)}.life-photos img{display:block;width:100%;height:340px;object-fit:cover;transition:transform .35s ease}.life-photos .life-main img{object-position:center top}.life-photos figure:hover img{transform:scale(1.02)}.life-photos figcaption{position:absolute;left:14px;right:14px;bottom:14px;padding:13px 15px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(4,34,62,.88);color:#fff;backdrop-filter:blur(5px)}.life-photos figcaption b,.life-photos figcaption span{display:block}.life-photos figcaption b{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:18px}.life-photos figcaption span{margin-top:3px;color:#e1eaf2;font-size:13px}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px;padding-bottom:80px}.cards article{background:var(--cream);border:1px solid #e6eaee;border-radius:12px;padding:30px}.cards h3{font-family:var(--font-display);color:var(--navy-dark);font-size:22px;margin:0 0 9px}.cards p{color:var(--slate);font-size:14px}.gallery-cta{background:#eef3f7;padding:62px 0}.gallery-cta .wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:30px}.gallery-cta a{color:var(--navy);font-weight:700;text-decoration:none}.visit{background:var(--navy-dark);color:#fff;text-align:center;padding:75px 0}.visit h2{color:#fff;font-size:36px}.visit p{color:#dce7f4;max-width:620px;margin:13px auto 25px}@media(max-width:700px){.hero{padding:72px 0}.intro,.cards,.life-photos{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px}.intro{padding-top:55px;padding-bottom:35px}.life-photos{padding-bottom:50px}.life-photos img{height:270px}.cards{padding-bottom:55px}.gallery-cta .wrap{display:block}.gallery-cta a{display:inline-block;margin-top:22px}.visit{padding:58px 0}}
</style>